    "Independent RAM views recover temporal/overlapping copies. Dispatch and each emitted body check its exact original footprint; multiple versions at one address remain distinct.",
    "The scripted retail sequence, unskipped introduction/audio and documented fresh-load clock paths execute without interpretation. Whole-game static coverage is not established.",
